sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant O as Orders
  participant T as order-events<br/>(SNS)
  participant Q as billing-orders<br/>(SQS)
  participant B as Billing
  participant D as invoices<br/>(DynamoDB)
  O->>T: order.created
  T->>Q: order.created
  Q->>B: deliver
  B->>D: put invoice
  B-->>Q: delete message
  Note over Q,B: failure: 3 tries, then DLQ
